  Ltac hide_sec :=
    change (?P) with (sf_hide P) in MI; change (?P) with (sf_hide P) in ST; change (?P) with (sf_hide P) in GOT;
    change (?P) with (sf_hide P) in SHB; change (?P) with (sf_hide P) in FB;
